@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Publik / Jamaah" as Jamaah
boundary "Halaman Utama / Cari\n(/ atau /cari)" as ArchivePage
boundary "Halaman Detail Laporan\n(/laporan/[id])" as DetailPage
control "Reports Query Handler\n(Server Component / API)" as ReportHandler
entity "Database\n(Prisma: Report, Attachment, Transaction)" as DB

Jamaah -> ArchivePage : Buka website Masjid Archive
activate ArchivePage

ArchivePage -> ReportHandler : Query laporan kas (group by tahun/bulan)
activate ReportHandler
ReportHandler -> DB : prisma.report.findMany({\n  include: { attachments: true },\n  orderBy: { reportDate: 'desc' }\n})
activate DB
DB --> ReportHandler : List laporan kas beserta lampiran
deactivate DB
ReportHandler --> ArchivePage : Data laporan terkelompok
deactivate ReportHandler

ArchivePage -> Jamaah : Tampilkan grid kartu laporan kas mingguan

opt Jamaah melakukan pencarian
  Jamaah -> ArchivePage : Ketik query di input pencarian (/cari)
  ArchivePage -> ArchivePage : Filter instan (tanggal, bulan, tahun, pekan)
  ArchivePage -> Jamaah : Tampilkan kartu laporan yang sesuai
end

Jamaah -> ArchivePage : Klik salah satu kartu laporan kas
deactivate ArchivePage

ArchivePage -> DetailPage : Navigasi ke /laporan/[id]
activate DetailPage

DetailPage -> ReportHandler : Ambil detail laporan & transaksi
activate ReportHandler
ReportHandler -> DB : prisma.report.findUnique({\n  where: { id },\n  include: {\n    attachments: true,\n    transactions: { where: { isVerified: true } }\n  }\n})
activate DB
note right of DB: Hanya transaksi isVerified: true\nyang ditampilkan ke publik
DB --> ReportHandler : Data laporan & transaksi publik
deactivate DB
ReportHandler --> DetailPage : Render detail laporan
deactivate ReportHandler

alt Lampiran bertipe PDF
  DetailPage -> DetailPage : Render embedded PDF viewer
else Lampiran gambar
  DetailPage -> DetailPage : Render zoomable image lightbox
end

DetailPage -> Jamaah : Tampilkan dokumen kas, saldo rekap, & daftar transaksi
deactivate DetailPage

@enduml
